        <section id="what-you-will-learn"  class="t-bg-primary1a">
          
            <h2>What you will learn</h2>
              <p>In this session you will learn about:</p>
<ul>
<li>Person-centred support</li>
<li>Treating the person with autism as an individual</li>
<li>Compassionate and non-judgemental support</li>
<li>Promoting the rights of individuals with autism.</li>
<li>Incorporating the preferences and needs of individuals</li>
<li>Importance of working with each individual’s strengths and abilities</li>
<li>The contribution of informal networks</li>
<li>Working in partnership with the individual and others</li>
<li>The principles of confidentiality</li>
</ul>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
