        <section id="person-centred-support"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Person centred support</h2>
              <p>Let’s start by looking at what is ‘person centred support’. Select from the images below to learn more about it.</p>

              
              <!-- IF 2 --><ul class="l-icon-grid ">
  
  
    
    <!--  -->
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/demo/ua_u2_s2_p1_reveal1.svg" alt="Planning and Decision Making" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Planning and Decision Making</h3>
      <p>A Person-centred approach within a family context can ensure that children, young people and their parents are involved in all aspects of planning and decision-making.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/demo/ua_u2_s2_p1_reveal2.svg" alt="Live the Life they Want" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Live the Life they Want</h3>
      <p>Person-centred support means that the individual whether child or adult, is at the centre of the service and the support works around them to help them live the life they want.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/demo/ua_u2_s2_p1_reveal3.svg" alt="Culturally Appropriate" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Culturally Appropriate</h3>
      <p>Person centred support and care, and the information people are given about it, should always be culturally appropriate.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
      
  
  
    
  
  <li class="c-reveal-block">
    <img class="c-reveal-block__icon js-showhide" src="~/images/svg/demo/ua_u2_s2_p1_reveal4.svg" alt="Services" width="266" height="266">
    
    <div class="c-reveal-block__desc">
      <h3 aria-hidden="true">Services</h3>
      <p>Person centred support is about services being flexible and not following a ‘one size fits all’ approach.</p>

    </div>
  </li>
  
</ul>

            
          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
