        <section id="treating-the-person-with-autism-as-an-individual"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
    <div class="l-media ">
        
        <h2 class="l-media__title">
          Treating the person with autism as an individual
        </h2>

      <div class="l-media__body ">
        <p>Person-centred care is a way of thinking and doing things that sees the person with autism as the focus. They are unique and as an individual need to be treated that way and not put into a pre planned mould. Support and care should always take into account their individual needs and preferences and they should have the opportunity to make informed decisions about their own care, in partnership with their healthcare professionals.</p>

      </div>
          <img class="l-media__img" src="~/images/svg/ua/ua_u2_s2_p1_image.svg" alt="" width="300" height="300" >  
    </div>
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
     
    
  
  
